  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Master&apos;s Degree Program  in Water Resources Management(2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensuring efficiency equity and sustainability of water resource development in developing countries through Integrated water resources management, water quality and ecosystem and water disasters. Notable courses guide regional observations and adaptive methodologies for managing floods, droughts, ecosystems, and disaster prevention under  Climate Change and Water Resources Management.  Students learn basic concepts, planning, management analysis methods for water resources, and apply mathematical techniques for watershed modeling in  Fundamentals of Water Resources  and  Watershed Modeling.   Water Governance and Management Policies  focuses on strategies and policies for effective water resource management.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To educate and train policy experts and public educator from developing countries who will work for water resources development and improvement of the quality of like in their respective countries. To teach and promote modalities among global talents who can contribute to water resources development in t heir countries.&#xac1c;&#xbc1c;&#xb3c4;&#xc0c1;&#xad6d; &#xc218;&#xc790;&#xc6d0;&#xad00;&#xb9ac;&#xc758; &#xd6a8;&#xc728;&#xc131; &#xc9c0;&#xc18d;&#xac00;&#xb2a5;&#xc131; &#xd655;&#xbcf4; &#xbc0f; &#xc774;&#xb97c; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc2dd;&#xb7c9;&#xc548;&#xbcf4; &#xc99d;&#xc9c4; &#xc5d0;&#xb108;&#xc9c0; &#xd6a8;&#xc728;&#xc131; &#xc99d;&#xc9c4; &#xc218;&#xc7ac;&#xd574; &#xb300;&#xc751; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
